  WrittenDialogue: "It was good, wasn’t it?\nOh my god, let’s order more and have an eating contest!\nHello my child.\nWho’re you?\nI’m Father Patrick. I noticed how you love the atmosphere of this establishment so much.\nNoticed from all the way across the room?\nYes, my child.\nWhy do you keep calling me “child” do you have a Daddy kink??\nI’m not quite sure what you mean. I merely desired to invite you to Sunday mass. I think you’d love it quite well.\nSunday mass? Like Church?\nYes, the house God built.\nI don’t know... What do you think?"
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KELLY\nKELLY\nPRIEST\nKELLY\nPRIEST\nKELLY\nPRIEST\nKELLY\nPRIEST\nKELLY\nPRIEST\nKELLY"
